{
  "_comment": "Final matrix: 5 answer models x 7 policies. Extraction is the published cached chain, so graphs are built from the same triples as every earlier run. P2 uses normalised relation matching (paper/RQ4 reports exact vs normalised vs llm). Answer models run with low reasoning effort where the API exposes it; qwen3-8b thinks as in the deep sensitivity run. Judge and P4 maintenance are fixed and never an answer model.",
